      "value": "Hey there, this is unusual and should not happen in 3.7.7, can you try these troubleshooting steps?\n\n1. Close and reopen the panel. \n\n2. If that doesn't work: restart unity.\n\n3. If that still doesn't work: reinstall the avatars SDK package with Unity closed.\n\nLet us know how it goes!",
