      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name} I suspect this was caused by a botched upgrade on my end. The latest release of gesture manager isn't compatible with 3.7.7, so it must have failed the domain reload and gotten caught in this strange state.\n\n3.7.7 doesn't appear to actually reference the \"You must accept the terms below\" string at all, so I must have not been running the new code one way or another. Probably fine to close this. Hopefully the new Gesture Manager patch can get into the curated repo before 3.7.7 ships.",
